      "type": "list_item",
      "source": "`buffer`: An [`MTLIndirectCommandBuffer`](mtlindirectcommandbuffer.md) instance that contains other commands the current command runs.",
      "normalizedSource": "`buffer`: An [`MTLIndirectCommandBuffer`](mtlindirectcommandbuffer.md) instance that contains other commands the current command runs.",
